    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347170/extras/0c69ef2570abf1d05258ef944a7ee50e.poster.avif?t=1749286130\" width=800 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347170/extras/0c69ef2570abf1d05258ef944a7ee50e.webm?t=1749286130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347170/extras/0c69ef2570abf1d05258ef944a7ee50e.mp4?t=1749286130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will be members of an up to 4 person crew. There are no assigned roles, so you'll have to communicate among the chaos and decide who will be:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manning the Guns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying the Ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operating the Radar and Auto-Turrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preventing the Reactor from Melting Down</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, EVERYONE will be repairing the ship constantly as it takes damage throughout combat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347170/extras/3018133ec5a0069883eee7f76b404661.poster.avif?t=1749286130\" width=800 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347170/extras/3018133ec5a0069883eee7f76b404661.webm?t=1749286130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347170/extras/3018133ec5a0069883eee7f76b404661.mp4?t=1749286130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your ship takes a missile to the aft compartment, there is no health bar slider that gets a bit lower. Instead, the aft compartment starts leaking air, perhaps the oxygen generator was stored there? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is up to you and your crew to decide what needs fixing first. Can your crew afford to take someone off of the guns to seal up the holes? Or perhaps you have plenty of oxygen stored up and sealing off the compartment is smarter for now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wish list and Join our Discord for Frequent Updates!</i></strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347170/extras/0c69ef2570abf1d05258ef944a7ee50e.poster.avif?t=1749286130\" width=800 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347170/extras/0c69ef2570abf1d05258ef944a7ee50e.webm?t=1749286130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347170/extras/0c69ef2570abf1d05258ef944a7ee50e.mp4?t=1749286130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will be members of an up to 4 person crew. There are no assigned roles, so you'll have to communicate among the chaos and decide who will be:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manning the Guns</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flying the Ship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operating the Radar and Auto-Turrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Preventing the Reactor from Melting Down</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, EVERYONE will be repairing the ship constantly as it takes damage throughout combat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347170/extras/3018133ec5a0069883eee7f76b404661.poster.avif?t=1749286130\" width=800 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347170/extras/3018133ec5a0069883eee7f76b404661.webm?t=1749286130\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347170/extras/3018133ec5a0069883eee7f76b404661.mp4?t=1749286130\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your ship takes a missile to the aft compartment, there is no health bar slider that gets a bit lower. Instead, the aft compartment starts leaking air, perhaps the oxygen generator was stored there? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is up to you and your crew to decide what needs fixing first. Can your crew afford to take someone off of the guns to seal up the holes? Or perhaps you have plenty of oxygen stored up and sealing off the compartment is smarter for now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Wish list and Join our Discord for Frequent Updates!</i></strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Project Horizon is a 1-4 player co-op first-person spaceship simulator where the entire crew needs to work together to carefully maintain the nuclear reactor, take up arms against enemy ships, and repair every leak and faulty electrical panel to survive.",
